			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://techhub.social/@jerryD\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>jerryD</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Right, both Chrome and Safari are now moving forward with shadowrootmode alongside shadowroot in Chrome being sunsetted.</p>",
